  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Juv 301.01 Initiation of Parole Process. The commissioner shall provide notice to the board that a juvenile is eligible for parole pursuant to RSA 170-H:6 or RSA 621:19.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Juv 300) #7844, eff 3-6-03, EXPIRED: 3-6-11\n\nNew. #9903, INTERIM, eff 4-16-11, EXPIRES: 10-13-11; ss by #10008-B, eff 9-30-11, EXPIRED: 9-30-19\n\nNew. #14223, eff 3-28-25",
